+    Rule:
+    - Crop section 1 to the bbox of its non-black cells.
+    - Recolor that crop with swapped roles: template cells take section 4's color and cropped black cells take
+      section 3's color.
+    - Count 4-connected non-black components in section 2 and repeat the recolored crop that many times, inserting
+      a 1-cell separator row or column colored with section 3 between adjacent copies.
